sequenceDiagram
    %% SD5 - Give feedback and complain
    %% Stories: 17, 39
    %% Description: A user contacts the administrators with feedback or a complaint, and an admin reads them.
    actor UP as User (person)
    actor AD as Admin
    participant U as User
    participant FB as Feedback
    participant CM as Complaint

    %% covers 39
    UP->>U: contact the administrators
    alt feedback
        U->>FB: feedback
    else complaint
        U->>CM: complaint
    end
    %% covers 17
    AD->>FB: read feedback
    %% covers 17
    AD->>CM: read complaints
